---
title: "Reading"
description: "Books I've read, logged from Goodreads and Rambling Readers and shelved by the year I started them."
date: 2026-10-12
eleventyNavigation:
  key: Reading
  parent: Habits
  order: 2
---

<p>{{ description }}</p>

<p>From late 2020 to early 2023 these were captured automatically by a Zapier connection to Goodreads, so each one was logged when I <em>started</em> it. From December 2022 I moved to <a href="https://ramblingreaders.org/user/si" rel="noopener">Rambling Readers</a>, an open source BookWyrm instance, which is where the finish dates, ratings and reviews come from. Books I only logged through Goodreads have a finish date and rating only where I marked them as read at the time. Everything here is read unless it's marked as to-read or currently reading.</p>

{% set books = collections.readingPosts | reverse %}
<p><strong>{{ books | length }} books logged.</strong></p>

{% set currentYear = "" %}
{% for book in books %}
  {% set year = book.date.getUTCFullYear() %}
  {% if year != currentYear %}
    {% if currentYear != "" %}</ul>{% endif %}
    <h2>{{ year }}</h2>
    <ul class="book-shelf">
    {% set currentYear = year %}
  {% endif %}
  <li class="book-spine">
    <a class="book-spine__link" href="{{ book.url | url }}">
      {% if book.data.book.cover %}
        <img class="book-spine__cover" src="{{ ('/img/reading/' + book.data.book.cover) | url }}" alt="" width="112" height="168" loading="lazy">
      {% else %}
        <span class="book-spine__cover book-spine__cover--blank" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      {% endif %}
      <span class="book-spine__title">{{ book.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="book-spine__author">{{ book.data.book.author }}</span>
      {% if book.data.reading.rating %}<span class="book-spine__rating" aria-label="Rated {{ book.data.reading.rating }} out of 5">{{ "★".repeat(book.data.reading.rating) }}</span>{% elif book.data.reading.status == "to-read" %}<span class="book-spine__rating">To read</span>{% elif book.data.reading.status == "reading" %}<span class="book-spine__rating">Reading</span>{% endif %}
    </a>
  </li>
{% endfor %}
{% if currentYear != "" %}</ul>{% endif %}
